{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "47c23a9df931e796e18afd310cf7233d17e852f80c870b63c8169e654548008b", "ja": "次回放送もお楽しみに！", "zh": "敬请期待下期播出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "629b53675db64d8b5fd22a80b9e95f8ccbb6a7549a8bff52bc550d9dd2a24ef0", "ja": "劇場へと帰る日、見送りに来てくれた店長、\n社長ちゃんとの別れを惜しむ4人。それぞれ\n気持ちを交わし合って帰路につき、思い出話\nに花を咲かせながら、お土産に貰った絶品の\nお弁当をシェアし合うのだった……。", "zh": "回剧场的那天，店长前来送行，4人依依不舍地与社长酱道别。大家互诉心意踏上归途，一边聊着往事，一边分享着作为伴手礼收到的绝品便当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "803fec2a5a39459275d575bce3f5cfc8a7940b4d952143ba2e1595d65e5631a2", "ja": "（収録も無事に終わり、東京に戻る日……。\nお世話になったお店のふたりが、見送りに来てくれた）", "zh": "（录制也顺利结束了，今天是回东京的日子……一直照顾我们的店里两位，也特地来为我们送行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1001_shachochan", "source_sha256": "a8ba7b92153c937c74eafcbb5c57884971308e2eb7dc93f6117ac6c8755fe13b", "ja": "なんや短い間やったのに、妙にさみしいなぁ……。\n絶対また遊びに来てな？　絶対やで！", "zh": "明明只待了一小会儿，却莫名觉得有些寂寞呢……。\n一定要再来玩哦？一定要来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "61648daa93b6bd9fd8693c66f3d4faa35dd8d240e4116cdd93b57497e32dee63", "ja": "うん、また会いにくるさー。\nありがとね、おかげですっごく楽しかったぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我还会再来看你的啦——\n谢谢你，多亏了你，我玩得特别开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "b1daa3be111496a6265c05ffe7ec0aa988b9195a51cceeabb4a6c286e973ecb4", "ja": "茜ちゃん的にも、すっごくためになったよ！\nビジネスの勉強させてくれて、ありがとね☆", "zh": "对小茜来说，也特别有收获呢！\n谢谢你让我学到了商业知识☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1004_shachochan", "source_sha256": "0b6500cf1a839c52256e8fecd2cefb9c341b0d31eee734b7048d62962c4b5374", "ja": "うぅ……ふたりとも、もしお弁当屋やりたくなったら\nいつでも言ってな！　お給料メッチャはずむから！", "zh": "呜呜……你们两个要是想开便当店，随时跟我说！工资我会给得特别丰厚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "972644b408410e10759c6f0af1e894cd41e9c10420dc7bb21ccb2185b1eb6fec", "ja": "あはは！　その時は連絡するさー！\nそれじゃあね！　元気でね！", "zh": "啊哈哈！到时候我会联系你的啦——！\n那就再见啦！要保重哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "aba6ba9ed1e7c62fc57d9c90ba7027b9e00e7d0577218766c9d11b6399ce1ae4", "ja": "社長ちゃんも、気が向いたら東京に遊びにおいでよ！\n茜ちゃんのライブにご招待しちゃうから☆", "zh": "社长，要是有兴趣的话，也来东京玩吧！\n我请你来看小茜的演唱会☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1007_tencho", "source_sha256": "e0b0f28ee03900979c4e1b0d453914dfb75bbdada561cc86647157e059f6a590", "ja": "……。\nその……ありがとうな。ホンマ世話んなった。", "zh": "……。\n那个……谢谢你啊。真是承蒙你照顾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "046164a509647780a40a702906e5c6c1fedd3a8ab3fc41317609d172110cd1b1", "ja": "いえ……こちらこそ、お世話になりました。\n一緒に仕事ができてよかったです。", "zh": "不……我也受了您许多照顾。\n能和您一起工作真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "082322e9fea99de0eb769aa0037ad7e654f90214ddba12a8ec236cf71d63a576", "ja": "ありがとうございました。教えてもらったお料理、\n帰ってから、早速挑戦してみますね！", "zh": "谢谢您。您教我的料理，回去后我会马上试着做做看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1010_tencho", "source_sha256": "ce7743caa7ae8ba8f8e7d95f4b1da7e6933e0109466d7843245ab2f026326f8f", "ja": "ああ、元気でな。それと……\nこれ、人数分あるから。新幹線で食べ。", "zh": "啊，保重。还有……\n这个，按人数准备好了。在新干线上吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0c86af4e63fa876b733b844812b4aa76a271711c2b91a3b07e02317d67006436", "ja": "え、これ……あっ、幕の内弁当！", "zh": "诶，这个……啊，是幕之内便当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ac4444ba7b37908bd87d1a28ed5d46f40e348b3c069ff08949f5ed0952ec36b3", "ja": "……。\nありがとうございます。いただきます。", "zh": "……。\n非常感谢。那我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "18b67872fb7376411d8d1ae5b1a265d0e7943dd8174664d7ac7efc6c1d26fcd3", "ja": "さて、と……みんな、改めてお疲れさま！\n色々あったけど、いい仕事になったな。", "zh": "那么……大家，再次辛苦了！\n虽然发生了各种各样的事，但这次工作完成得很不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "f7574a1bfda9bd744dca058474d5fa4ea4d15bc66edb431d8aef389a5ef73919", "ja": "うんうん！　ツアーの宣伝もしっかりできたし、\nミッションコンプリートだね☆", "zh": "嗯嗯！巡演的宣传也好好做到了，任务完成☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "dd1b83bfffdeb65b7de7d2c03763a4a7d207aa20b8d89e2183a59fac63fc60f1", "ja": "まあ、勝負に負けたのは悔しかったけど……\n全力出したから悔いはないぞ！　悔しいけど！", "zh": "虽然输了比赛很不甘心……\n但响全力以赴了所以不后悔！虽然很不甘心就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "ac775b1c0b37c92aca0e392e82228a4183fa9557f866448c3894e69cbc480b87", "ja": "タコライス、みんな美味しいって喜んでくれたし、\n新メニューにしてくれるそうだしね。", "zh": "塔可饭，大家都说好吃，可开心了，而且听说还会把它加入新菜单呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "80e5b3403088ea644324683980692f77a460d0a98727720e042a17a8dcd734e7", "ja": "我那覇さんたちもですか？　私たちの\nスペシャル幕の内も、新メニューにしてくれるそうで。", "zh": "我那霸小姐她们也是吗？听说我们的特别幕之内便当也会被列为新菜单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "fe349a4acf6d490348cd278828f62a6b31ee208a0c0af5bb5fb98a1dd4e7eaba", "ja": "つむりんたちも、そのお弁当もらってたよね？\n茜ちゃんたちも、タコライス弁当もらったんだよ～！", "zh": "紬她们也拿到那个便当了吧？\n小茜她们也拿到塔可饭便当了哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "41c2d403f51947e736c38ec43b30d8ef3dddadcb82ed02712049d0e27b2eca35", "ja": "ではせっかくですから、\nみんなでシェアしませんか？　帰りの新幹線の中で。", "zh": "既然难得有这个机会，要不要大家一起分享？在回去的新干线里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "2ff5a2ac6e2b03e3359b4466f23edc801e9c0455fc61d5535a39f07f94a825b0", "ja": "賛成！　{$P$}も食べて、\nどっちが美味しいか、感想教えてよ。", "zh": "我赞成！{$P$}也吃一份，然后告诉我哪个更好吃，记得说说感想哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d16b2fdf016b72251874c23d198639ca301ef7ed655e1713476660035c22afc5", "ja": "え、いいのか？　もらっちゃって。", "zh": "诶，真的可以吗？那我就收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "939316181635a569739999dd977652963085d07ddb64f2143e5487eb7c4c7703", "ja": "もちろん！　限定茜ちゃんスマイルと\nサーターアンダギーもセットでね！　ニコッ☆", "zh": "当然啦！限定小茜笑容和\n冲绳开口笑也是配套的哦！笑☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0ba298c4624d17ae111cf7ecde1f3c0bd98a47a293d9757391673911f110bddf", "ja": "どうしても食べたくないと仰るのなら、\n無理にとは言いませんが……でなければ、どうぞ。", "zh": "如果您实在不想吃，我也不会强求……不然的话，请用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6e9903f34e88cd6293c34d4ddc8cbcc27974a6bd539efc669437801a3e4ff3ff", "ja": "い、いやいや、いただくよ！\n実はずっと、気になってたんだよな……美味しそうで。", "zh": "不、不用不用，我吃就是了！\n其实我一直挺在意的……看起来很好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b24137042e9813aef33b3e5c758fdc2702fec04402e0c1dcbcbce1aca5a4d388", "ja": "ふふっ、きっとほっぺたが落ちちゃいますよ♪\nそれじゃ、帰りましょうか。", "zh": "呵呵，肯定好吃得让人连脸颊都要掉下来了哦♪  \n那么，我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d1fcec1fd845f19126a92ece80f0f78ada0170a928ac27b6ec647c9daac36563", "ja": "（このお弁当は、店長さん達からの信頼の証。\n全力で戦い抜いたアイドル達への、勲章だな……！）", "zh": "（这份便当，是店长们信任的证明。也是献给拼尽全力战斗到底的偶像们的勋章啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2f693684fe21890f30244bb2e2dd557480b6bb039a31e00a4a7b0cffaf3c846a", "ja": "（……うまっ！？　これ……うまっ！）", "zh": "（……好吃！？这个……真好吃！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
